<title>USA: Omaha cattle off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were $0.50 to $1.00 lower, compared to last Tuesday.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1100-1375 lbs 69.00-70.00, load reputation 70.50. Select 66.00-68.50.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1000-1200 lbs 68.50-69.50, package Choice 2-3 1100 lbs 70.00. Select 66.00-68.00.</p>
</text>
